#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:693
#: 29dcbb6a83e146158c8656d64deedb84
msgid ""
"Using manufactured Plastic and Fiberglass Components in Your Own Frames."
msgstr "在您自己的机架中使用量产塑料和玻璃纤维零部件。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:695
#: ad3597493efe4b6fadfba13080790d00
msgid ""
"Although often not reasonable to make yourself some parts can be used "
"effectively in your own designs."
msgstr "虽然自制往往不太合理，但某些零部件可以在您自己的设计中有效使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:697
#: ca2efe5d20d04e89a8678763296e20a7
msgid ""
"There are retrofit kits like the Team Blacksheep FPV subframe for a DJI "
"Flamewheel quadcopter that reuse its plastic frame arms."
msgstr "有些改装套件，例如用于DJI Flamewheel四轴飞行器的Team Blacksheep FPV副机架，可以复用其塑料机架臂。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:699
#: 37abe12330b9465696c3cf2a842c8937
msgid ""
"And there are many cases where components from various frames can be used to"
" good effect in our own designs."
msgstr "在许多情况下，来自各种机架的零部件可以在我们自己的设计中发挥良好的作用。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:701
#: edae8feb24fb403fb65ac2cfd3f45aba
msgid ""
"Clearly it is necessary to research your individual design to assure that "
"the component pieces are actually available from the distributors."
msgstr "显然，有必要研究您的个人设计，以确保所需的零部件实际上可以从经销商处获得。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:704
#: c3493115126745dd8a1960c4ee637fd5
msgid "Research can provide an excellent source of very desirable components:"
msgstr "调研可以提供非常理想零部件的优质来源："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:708
#: 5d48a7019462480cbfaf96f9dfcec52d
msgid ""
"Or the $14.00 CNC milled ultra tough `fiberglass frame arms "
"<http://www.hoverthings.com/fliparmblack>`__ used in the Hoverthings "
"Quadcopters:"
msgstr ""
"或者14美元的CNC铣制超硬 `玻璃纤维机架臂 <http://www.hoverthings.com/fliparmblack>`__ "
"，用于Hoverthings四轴飞行器："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:718
#: f3e2676e4b174edcb64cf464e72dcbe7
msgid ""
"DJI injection molded frame arms from their Flamewheel copters are used in "
"the `TBS Discovery FPV frame. <http://team-"
"blacksheep.com/products/product:98>`__"
msgstr ""
"DJI Flamewheel飞行器的注塑成型机架臂被用于 `TBS Discovery FPV机架。 <http://team-"
"blacksheep.com/products/product:98>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:724
#: 224fe613e63b4e668dccf12c034efb2f
msgid ""
"Clearly using manufactured parts will require research as to suitability and"
" size for your project as well as actual availability."
msgstr "显然，使用量产零件需要研究其是否适合您的项目尺寸以及实际的可用性。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:727
#: 09bbaa86e5484fcf979cc2517847b7d6
msgid ""
"But  if you can accommodate them they can make your project simpler and "
"better."
msgstr "但如果您能适配它们，它们可以使您的项目更简单、更好。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:731
#: da8c9eff8b3d47f9a0dcffb41e49d16a
msgid "Homemade waterproof frame using a hinged electrical box"
msgstr "使用铰链电气盒的自制防水机架"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:733
#: eb6436ade8194c658f7190f112ac9fb0
msgid ""
"An absolutely excellent, very clean, rugged and waterproof design using "
"carbon fiber arms and plastic electrical and plumbing parts."
msgstr "一款绝对出色、非常整洁、坚固且防水的设计，使用碳纤维臂和塑料电气及管道配件。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:739
#: 1402ace574494e8a856c350996ac81a4
msgid ""
"Here is a link to `Alec Short's construction article in Makezine "
"<http://makezine.com/projects/wavecopter-a-waterproof-quadcopter/>`__"
msgstr ""
"这里是 `Alec Short在Makezine上的制作文章 <http://makezine.com/projects/wavecopter-a-"
"waterproof-quadcopter/>`__ 的链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:740
#: 7a93308881dd408a9436825e617a43f7
msgid ""
"I really like the use of the central 4 way hub for stabilizing the tubes and"
" the slip fit adjustable tension T's for motor mounts are also great."
msgstr "我真的很喜欢用中央四向枢纽来稳定管材的设计，以及用于电机座的滑配可调张力T形件也很棒。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:743
#: 9ee59669d07b485db0da162894e2d294
msgid ""
"The mounting of n Pixhawk or APM2.x would really require the separate GPS / "
"compass module in order to work correctly."
msgstr "安装Pixhawk或APM2.x确实需要单独的GPS/罗盘模块才能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:745
#: e4b63275fa654e83b4098628f26c7c14
msgid ""
"There are a wide variety of latch type weatherproof electrical boxes which "
"could be used for this."
msgstr "有多种锁扣式防风雨电气盒可用于此目的。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:747
#: bdabe8ecfa3945328b7b6d5d6f0c6de4
msgid ""
"The  main requirement is to get CF tube with an outer diameter appropriate "
"to the plumbing / electrical fittings you want to use."
msgstr "主要要求是获取外径适合您要使用的管道/电气配件的CF管。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:749
#: 1f218037c3f9443f98ef2322713d88c7
msgid ""
"I'll definitely be visiting the electrical and plumbing section the next "
"time I'm in Home Depot."
msgstr "下次去Home Depot时，我一定会去参观电气和管道区。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:753
#: 8cb018baea72426592e7f8d6f6429a96
msgid "Vacuum Formed Frames and Components."
msgstr "真空成型机架和零部件。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:755
#: c1c15431d62146e6b88e81d9e4326cb6
msgid ""
"Although this is specialized and requires a vacuum forming \"press\" it may "
"be justified for some applications."
msgstr "虽然这是专业化的，需要真空成型\"压机\"，但对某些应用可能是值得的。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:758
#: 45154b6e7e3c4f75bb6abc4e3361fa24
msgid ""
"A vacuum molding press can be made relatively inexpensively that can make "
"whole small shell type frames or for components."
msgstr "可以以相对低廉的成本制造真空成型压机，用于制作整个小型壳式机架或零部件。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:760
#: 8810a298efe94c749b8bf94d3969c457
msgid ""
"Copters made this way can be made weather tight and even water proof and "
"they can be incredibly tough."
msgstr "以这种方式制造的飞行器可以做到防风雨甚至防水，且可以非常坚固。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:762
#: 4756d073b692488297c832d68cbd488c
msgid ""
"Kydex is a laminated plastic sheet that produces a quite strong monocoque "
"shell when molded properly."
msgstr "Kydex是一种叠层塑料板，正确成型后可产生相当强固的硬壳结构。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:764
#: 93f72856a5134f23be988fa5ed42f6bb
msgid ""
"The no longer in production Safe Flight Copters SFC4410-1 vacuum formed "
"propeller protected H Quad Frame."
msgstr "已停产的Safe Flight Copters SFC4410-1真空成型螺旋桨保护H型四轴机架。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:770
#: 61c8260657bc4e238da43e2153028ab3
msgid ""
"And the inexpensive ($120.00) and extra tough, water proof `Aquacopter frame"
" <http://www.aquacopters.com/>`__"
msgstr "以及价格低廉（120美元）、超级坚固的防水 `Aquacopter机架 <http://www.aquacopters.com/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:777
#: f31bef19d33a4e67a4cfb274d9329497
msgid ""
"A fully functional vacuum forming system can actually be constructed with a "
"shop vacuum and an electric grill."
msgstr "实际上可以用一台工业吸尘器和一个电烤架构建一个全功能的真空成型系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:783
#: 43b2f730324a42e2961420522bdad689
msgid ""
"Vacuum forming can also be used to make central shells for copters with "
"tube, plastic or fiber glass frame arms."
msgstr "真空成型也可用于为带有管材、塑料或玻璃纤维机架臂的飞行器制作中央外壳。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:785
#: 18582eadb83643b29b1816b984e0c1c3
msgid ""
"This may be over specialized for most uses, but if you want to make tough, "
"light central frame shells or covers."
msgstr "这对大多数用途来说可能过于专业，但如果您想制作坚固、轻质的中央机架外壳或外罩。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:787
#: 1dfda93a83d74a908753a937042ee461
msgid ""
"Or, if you want to build multiple small to medium Quadcopters that are tough"
" and waterproof this could be just the ticket."
msgstr "或者，如果您想制造多架坚固防水的小到中型四轴飞行器，这可能正是您所需要的。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:789
#: a80ed5702253464ba9185e53909eb400
msgid "(Or you could just buy an Aquacopter frame!!!)"
msgstr "（或者您可以直接买一个Aquacopter机架！！！）"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:793
#: b5996b41c8bd435e88569c3137a1e8bf
