msgstr "具体制作示例与技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:795
#: 23f0f86dc8914b118d58b00ffa7aa759
msgid ""
"Some design considerations for a medium large, high efficiency, heavy lift "
