#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:907
#: 80dc3addf5ce4ecf8cde387225d2486a
msgid "A link to Stuart Dodin's really nice X8 heavy lifter Octocopter"
msgstr "Stuart Dodin非常出色的X8重载八轴飞行器的链接"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:913
#: cb5b70b1f83e47b6b879f7251f0f81e6
msgid "A Commercial MultiCopter Exhibiting Advanced Design Concepts"
msgstr "一款展示先进设计理念的商用多旋翼飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:915
#: 127cdf72cfe64ea5bbc119bc3e9e24a6
msgid ""
"Here is an example of an excellent QuadCopter design: the Aeryon SkyRanger "
"for high end UAV applications."
msgstr "这里是一款优秀四轴飞行器设计的示例：用于高端无人机应用的Aeryon SkyRanger。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:921
#: b04832819faa4ea6af6a7f9c80b978ca
msgid ""
"This copter has a lot of things right and is really a study in good design "
"and quality construction."
msgstr "这款飞行器有很多值得称道之处，确实是一项优秀设计和高质量制造的范例。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:924
#: f1d2e9ea0d18446ebc4c2f02a11b8901
msgid ""
"The rotating ball full enclosure camera Gimbal provides good weather "
"protection and improved performance."
msgstr "旋转球形全封闭相机云台提供了良好的防风雨保护和更好的性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:926
#: 61266aad207f42c8a4881fe7cf1a85b2
msgid "The motors are on the bottom under the arms."
msgstr "电机位于机臂下方底部。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:928
#: 2b884f0fa57c44eda3751453076ebfbf
msgid ""
"More aerodynamically efficient with no prop wash interference and very "
"little intake interference."
msgstr "空气动力学效率更高，无桨洗干扰，进气干扰极小。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:930
#: 57c6c52ce5ca46c995aee7fe699f93e6
msgid ""
"Noticeably increased flight times, greater lift capability and quieter as "
"well."
msgstr "飞行时间明显延长，升力能力更强，同时也更安静。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:933
#: b41a8d690d2c4b47b067bad3adc31354
msgid ""
"High torque, low KV \"pancake\" style motors and slow turning, large "
"diameter, high efficiency props."
msgstr "高扭矩、低KV\"扁平\"型电机和转速低、直径大、高效率的螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:936
#: 8adf816fb4c94b4593b68dcb9a92ae7b
msgid ""
"This is much more efficient than faster motors with smaller diameter "
"conventional design props."
msgstr "这比使用较小直径传统螺旋桨的高转速电机效率高得多。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:938
#: 4224bed093444c15bc503122c2cad01b
msgid ""
"This also increases flight times and load capacity and reduces the sound "
"footprint."
msgstr "这也延长了飞行时间和载荷能力，并降低了噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:941
#: 404072746ee64568b707dafa28466cd2
msgid ""
"Tapered carbon fiber frame arms are more aerodynamically efficient and are "
"light and very strong."
msgstr "锥形碳纤维机架臂空气动力学效率更高，轻量且非常坚固。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:943
#: d4a68a483dda40438d87785e10476f36
msgid ""
"The fully enclosed weather tight framework with snap latch type access makes"
" maintaining the copter easy."
msgstr "完全封闭的防风雨框架配卡扣式开口，使维护飞行器变得容易。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:945
#: 44e1c184a40547ea98e2114bb24942c6
msgid ""
"A simple spring loaded landing gear provides for uneven landing sites and "
"minimal interference with the prop wash."
msgstr "简单的弹簧式起落架可适应不平整着陆场地，并对桨洗的干扰最小。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:951
#: e045aec820c24c2e8c747e5feea4b69e
msgid ""
"This QuadCopter incorporates several excellent design concepts and shows "
"what can be done without budget constraints."
msgstr "这款四轴飞行器融合了多项优秀设计理念，展示了不受预算限制时可以实现的成就。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:954
#: 9b6bec13875e4d33a61d130ef50fefa6
msgid ""
"The Skyranger has features we can use in our own designs but it is important"
" to understand all designs are compromises."
msgstr "Skyranger有我们可以在自己设计中借鉴的特性，但重要的是要理解所有设计都是妥协的结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:957
#: e6d8c8a23da64365b49046c3dbbd0a6f
msgid ""
"The 3DRobotics Iris is one of the best designed QuadCopters that you can "
"actually get and it is a real bargain."
msgstr "3DRobotics Iris是您实际能买到的设计最好的四轴飞行器之一，而且非常划算。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:961
#: 0b1214f7c6824d79b5ff48c895283c19
msgid "Conclusion and Additional Design Considerations"
msgstr "结论与其他设计注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:963
#: 1f9a4c5e7a6140f7bb5a03f4b4b13407
msgid "I have not covered either 3D printing or CNC machining."
msgstr "我没有涉及3D打印或CNC加工。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:965
#: c6df2d01cd254c8da54eb90099076535
msgid ""
"These are both perfectly valid techniques for either whole frames or for "
"parts or accessories."
msgstr "这两种方法对于整体机架或零部件及配件都是完全有效的技术。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:967
#: 0a51d493da10412da44ec09ae0933c03
msgid ""
"But most people do not have the equipment or capability which is why they "
"are not covered here."
msgstr "但大多数人没有相应设备或能力，这就是为什么这里没有涉及的原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:969
#: 47d9e493c7c94b389df6c4b3ac64f90f
msgid ""
"Clearly if you have either of these capabilities they can greatly enhance "
"your copter projects."
msgstr "显然，如果您具备这些能力，它们可以极大地增强您的飞行器项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:972
#: d69f6589584d4cb5b5a27d04c85e95ec
msgid ""
"I have also not covered in depth hand laid fiberglass or carbon fiber or "
"vacuum bagging."
msgstr "我也没有深入介绍手工铺制玻璃纤维或碳纤维以及真空袋工艺。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:975
#: b19e27491e744b6a91cd79723c5fa431
msgid ""
"You can make Dynamite frames or shells this way but this too requires "
"serious individual skill  and capability (especially carbon fiber)."
msgstr "您可以用这种方法制作出色的机架或外壳，但这也需要严肃的个人技能和能力（尤其是碳纤维）。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:979
#: a7517b9242e74a019a073b03126392dc
msgid ""
"I have also not gone into detail about the engineering criteria for "
"multicopters:"
msgstr "我也没有详细介绍多旋翼飞行器的工程标准："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:982
#: 8b4398b101854079aed9ecc5b956cbdf
msgid "I don't know."
msgstr "我不知道。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:983
#: ee17d040bd504b64a0bf3fa870ddaa89
msgid "From what I've seen very few people do."
msgstr "据我所见，很少有人知道。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:984
#: 8834a6d2f84f4883a5b34e649cfc962a
msgid ""
"C. One who does is Paul Pounds PHD and here is his Paper on the subject: \\ "
"`Quadrotors <http://eprints.qut.edu.au/33833/1/33833.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""
"C. 其中一位知道的是Paul Pounds博士，这是他关于这个主题的论文：\\ `Quadrotors "
"<http://eprints.qut.edu.au/33833/1/33833.pdf>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:987
#: 58b15f2e7709452397b3191cbeff885a
msgid ""
"If you stick to a simple design and try to keep frame arm to a simple single"
" small tube under the prop wash it will work fine."
msgstr "如果您坚持简单设计，并尽量将机架臂保持为螺旋桨洗流下的单根小管，它就能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:990
#: 47be3b58e2434d5d97293438f38369c0
msgid ""
"Round tubing has about half the flat plate area (prop wash interference) as "
"the same sized square tubing."
msgstr "圆形管材的平板面积（桨洗干扰）约为同尺寸方管的一半。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:992
#: b042bddb58a44b5c84b36be28bff291e
msgid ""
"You can improve efficiency by putting the motor prop under the frame arm but"
" then there are frame design and clearance issues."
msgstr "您可以通过将电机螺旋桨置于机架臂下方来提高效率，但这会带来机架设计和间距问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:995
#: 66d978e8f6dc426f98c00bdb9ad6613f
msgid ""
"Try to keep the weight centralized as much as possible and keep the "
"autopilot near the horizontal center if possible."
msgstr "尽量将重量集中，并尽可能将飞控保持在水平中心附近。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:998
#: 837f262efb654136b304cd8ff50fa355
msgid ""
"So that the copter tends to roll and pitch as though pivoting around the "
"center of mass and around the autopilot."
msgstr "这样飞行器的横滚和俯仰就像围绕质心和飞控旋转一样。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:1000
#: 4410201a78684440be96ebe9e437c606
msgid ""
"However it is not as critical as some people have made it out to be because "
"the stabilizing throttles will automatically compensate."
msgstr "然而，这并不像有些人所说的那么关键，因为稳定油门会自动补偿。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-multicopter-design.rst:1004
#: b38a86320d074232a7f2c7f08766fc84
msgid ""
"You can do a lot with a rudimentary understanding of the forces involved, if"
" you need more it is a career, not a hobby."
msgstr "对所涉及的力有基本了解就能做很多事情，如果您需要更深入了解，那就是职业而非爱好了。"
